that's long crotch.
这就叫卡裆。

158
00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.100
So what do I do?
那我该怎么办？

159
00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:16.880
I've worn them.
我已经穿过它们了。

160
00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.440
I can't take them back and get the smaller size.
我没法退货换小一码的。

161
00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:22.260
I think I could get someone to alter it in the back.
我觉得我可以找人把后面改一下。

162
00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:25.380
You know, I like the sassy cargo minus the long crotch.
你知道的，我喜欢时髦的工装裤，除了卡裆这一点。

163
00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.120
What are we doing today?
我们今天要做什么？

164
00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.840
All right, let me tell you.
好了，我来告诉你们。

165
00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:31.340
For those of you guys wanting to know what we're doing today.
对于那些想知道我们今天要做什么的人。

166
00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:35.720
It is Business Ethics, Season 5, Episode 3.
这是《商界伦理》，第五季，第三集。

167
00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:36.620
Oh, yeah.
哦，耶。

168
00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:41.040
It is written by Ryan Coe and directed by Jeffrey Blitz.
编剧是瑞安·科，导演是杰弗里·布里茨。

169
00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.080
Love it.
太喜欢了。

170
