176
00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.440
I know, you get immunity.
我知道，你获得了豁免权。

177
00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.780
Everything you say.
你说的每一句话。

178
00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.780
And then we're going to light the torch for you.
然后我们要为你点燃火炬。

179
00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.800
Well, some things are revealed.
好吧，有些事情被揭露了。

180
00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.740
Again, we will discuss.
同样，我们会讨论的。

181
00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.600
And it's going to cause a rift between Michael and Holly.
并且这将在迈克尔和霍莉之间引发裂痕。

182
00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:19.180
Yeah.
是啊。

183
00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:23.640
Meanwhile, Jim makes Dwight observe the company's time theft policy.
与此同时，吉姆让德怀特遵守公司的工时盗窃政策。

184
00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:28.680
And Meredith provides Outback Steakhouse takeout to the entire office.
而且梅雷迪思为整个办公室提供了澳拜客牛排的外卖。

185
00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.620
So that's our summary.
这就是我们的梗概。

186
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.200
Would you like fast fact number one?
你想听冷知识第一条吗？

187
00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.020
I really would.
我真的很想听。

188
00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:35.840
All right.
好的。

189
00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.200
New writer alert.
新编剧预警。

190
00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:37.880
Oh.
哦。

191
00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:41.100
Writer Ryan Coe has joined the staff for Season 5.
编剧瑞安·科加入了第五季的工作团队。

192
00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:41.760
Hello, Ryan.
你好，瑞安。

193
00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:42.180
Welcome.
欢迎。

194
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:42.760
Hello, Ryan.
你好，瑞安。

195
00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.220
He was only with us for one season as he left to work on Cougar Town.
他只和我们合作了一季，因为他离开去参与《熟女镇》的工作了。

