00:46:18.740 --> 00:46:20.480
Well, I looked at the script.
嗯，我看了剧本。

1015
00:46:20.920 --> 00:46:22.500
It was scripted.
剧本里就是这么写的。

1016
00:46:22.840 --> 00:46:26.120
