He said he watched Cookie Monster Sings Chocolate Rain about a thousand times.
他说他把《甜饼怪唱巧克力雨》看了大概有一千遍。

1038
00:47:16.800 --> 00:47:17.940
Did you go watch it?
你去找来看了吗？

1039
00:47:18.240 --> 00:47:19.240
I had to know.
我非得弄明白不可。

1040
00:47:19.440 --> 00:47:19.920
Of course.
当然了。

1041
00:47:20.300 --> 00:47:21.140
Here's the thing.
关键是这样的。

1042
00:47:21.320 --> 00:47:21.500
What?
什么？

1043
00:47:21.840 --> 00:47:29.300
Chocolate Rain, according to its Wikipedia page, was a song by American singer Tay Zonday.
根据维基百科的介绍，《巧克力雨》是美国歌手泰·宗戴的一首歌。

1044
00:47:29.520 --> 00:47:31.240
I went and watched Tay's last night.
我昨晚去看了泰的视频。

1045
00:47:31.580 --> 00:47:32.320
Oh, you did?
哦，你看了？

1046
00:47:32.460 --> 00:47:32.720
I did.
我看了。

1047
00:47:32.820 --> 00:47:33.980
You watched it as well?
你也看了吗？

1048
00:47:34.080 --> 00:47:34.320
Yeah.
对。

1049
00:47:34.780 --> 00:47:35.180
Yes.
看了。

1050
00:47:35.360 --> 00:47:39.100
So he wrote this song and he uploaded a video to YouTube.
所以他写了这首歌，并把视频上传到了YouTube。

1051
00:47:39.100 --> 00:47:41.840
It was four minutes, 52 seconds long.
它全长4分52秒。

1052
00:47:41.980 --> 00:47:44.860
He uploaded it, everyone, because I know you want to know.
他上传了这段视频，各位，因为我知道你们很想知道。

1053
00:47:45.000 --> 00:47:46.600
April 22nd, 2007.
2007年4月22日。

1054
00:47:46.960 --> 00:47:48.560
I remember it went viral.
我记得它当时火遍了全网。

1055
00:47:48.840 --> 00:47:49.280
Viral.
病毒式传播。

1056
00:47:49.620 --> 00:47:51.020
Like before things went viral.
就像在事情真正开始病毒式传播之前一样。

1057
00:47:51.200 --> 00:47:54.840
It was ranked the hottest viral video of summer 2007.
它被评为2007年夏天最热门的病毒视频。

1058
00:47:55.120 --> 00:47:59.300
And it was awarded the 2008 YouTube Award in the category of music.
它还荣获了2008年YouTube音乐类奖项。

1059
00:47:59.600 --> 00:48:05.460
So this song then became the subject of like parodies, remixes, tributes.
于是这首歌成了各种恶搞、混音和致敬的对象。

